dsh-token-cost README · 自定义渠道单价（可选）：同一个模型可能走不同渠道、单价不同（例如 DeepSeek 模型经由第三方中转）。可以给「渠道 × 模型」
单独定价，命中后按固定价估算（元/百万 token，**不分峰谷**）：

```json
{
  "channelRates": {
    "<provider 名>": {
      "<模型名或归一化键或 *>": { "cacheHit": 1, "cacheMiss": 2, "output": 3, "cacheWrite": 0 }

dsh-token-cost README · Custom channel rates (optional)：The same model can be served through different channels with different prices (for example DeepSeek
models behind a third-party relay). You can price a **channel × model** explicitly; a hit is billed at
that flat rate (CNY per 1M tokens, **no peak/off-peak split**):

```json
{
  "channelRates": {
    "<provider name>": {
      "<model name / normalized key / *>": { "cacheHit": 1, "cacheMiss": 2, "output": 3, "cacheWrite": 0 }
